{"script":"yd_036_05","des":"贝尔卡-熟识2","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","noIn":false,"addImg":"","y":-125,"mirrow":false,"x":-500,"scaleY":1.5,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","noIn":false,"addImg":"","y":-125,"mirrow":false,"x":-500,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1h","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":290,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1h","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":290,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]我其实从小就是个书虫啦。也就是那种喜欢非常喜欢读书的人。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]我小时候攒下钱来买的书甚至能把空房堆满，就连家里常备的粮食储存都比不上我藏书量的一半。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]而且我什么类型的书都爱看，文学、艺术、理论甚至武侠小说都在我的收藏之列，其中也包括那本超流行的《湖风剑侠志》～好像埃迪蒂那家伙，特别喜欢它呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]就算在大书院留学期间也一样，我只要一有空就会呆在图书馆里看书，就连教授都惊叹我的阅读量呢……啊哈，好像有点自吹自擂了……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]对了，你也喜欢读书呢！我们可以多交流交流呀～！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":290,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":290,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]你问我成为水占师的理由？这个……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]不知不觉，我们也可以聊起这么私人的话题了啊。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1h","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]成为水占师的理由……仔细想想好像也没有什么特别的理由，只是单纯不想平平凡凡地度过一生吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]不过成为水占师之后，我开始有了自己的思考、理想和期望，开始想要用自己的知识和力量帮助到更多的人……！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]而现在的目标嘛……短期来看，应该是让乌帕露帕这样的后辈能够尽快成才，独当一面吧～[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}]}